0,,Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack PhosCity ScolinesDialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,ZamanlamaDialogue: 1,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,ZamanlamaDialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Gab VillagerDialogue: 1,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.28,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Gab VillagerDialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.79,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Altyazı Düzenleme [TR]Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.79,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Altyazı Düzenleme [TR]Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.79,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Jack Cohle -onepacetr.net-Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.79,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Jack Cohle -onepacetr.net-Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,RawsDialogue: 1,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,RawsDialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Neo-RawsDialogue: 1,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Neo-RawsDialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Çevirmen [TR]Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Çevirmen [TR]Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaşgarlı -onepacetr.net-Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.25,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaşgarlı -onepacetr.net-Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:02:00.01,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:52.93,0:01:55.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yüzgeç parçalandı!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.77,0:02:04.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu veletin yaptığına bak!Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.52,0:02:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi yok etmeye mi çalışıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.65,0:02:07.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.86,0:02:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zeff'in kafasını patlat!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yap hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.28,0:02:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-Ama bize verdiği 100 öğün yemek sayesinde hayattayız!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin, seni pislik!Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.83,0:02:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.04,0:02:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Size saldırdığım falan yok.Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.42,0:02:30.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece yüzgeci kırdım.Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, kamarot!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.31,0:02:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yaptığını sanıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Batıracağım.Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.97,0:02:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu gemiyi batıracağım.Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.35,0:02:45.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Bu hiç komik değil! – Bu hiç komik değil!Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yani açıklaman bu mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.90,0:02:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Delirdin mi sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi yok edersem, saldıracak bir nedenleri olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.78,0:02:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen ne biliyorsun ki?Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.99,0:02:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana gösterilen nezaket hakkında...Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.91,0:03:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yer hakkında ne biliyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Restoran için ölecek misin yani?Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Salak falan mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölerek...Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.04,0:03:12.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölerek bir iyiliğin karşılığını ödeyemezsin.Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni bunun için kurtarmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.47,0:03:19.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayatın kurtarıldıktan sonra yine de ölmek...Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.47,0:03:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,zayıf birinin yapacağı bir şey!Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu durumun çözülmesi için başka yol var mı ki?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapmayın ama çocuklar...Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.06,0:03:30.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kavga etmeyin.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.98,0:03:33.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir durumda birbirinize düşmeniz rezillik.Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.28,0:03:38.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hem o bizim rehinemizken, artık numara çekemezsiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.78,0:03:42.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rakibinizin biz olması, sizin talihsizliğiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.49,0:03:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim alevli incilerimle ölümüne yanın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden...Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.47,0:04:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin-san?Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.06,0:04:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm, Pearl.Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yolumdan çekil...Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.32,0:04:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bize ihanet mi ediyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm, Don Krieg.Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.95,0:04:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O bizim hayatlarımızı kurtardı.Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun bu şekilde ölmesini istemiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En azından...Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En azından onu kendi ellerimle gömmeme izin verin.Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.21,0:04:38.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aklını mı kaçırdın,Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan Filosu Komutanı?Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Korsan Filosu Komutanı mı?Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öylesine bir serseri değil mi yani?Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.48,0:04:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adamın kalkanını parçaladı... Ne güç ama…!Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gördün mü? Onu caydırma planım işe yaradı.Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yalancı!Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.36,0:05:03.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten gemiyi parçalayacaktın, değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.53,0:05:04.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.62,0:05:05.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.58,0:05:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu gemiyi incinmeden terk etmeni istedim ama belli ki öyle olmayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.50,0:05:13.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, öyle.Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.25,0:05:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En azından seni kendi ellerimle gömerek...Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,işleri düzelteceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.72,0:05:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sağol.Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bok parçası!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.68,0:05:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen de hasır şapkalı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.01,0:05:27.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sıkıntı yok...Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.01,0:05:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi bir pısırığa karşı kaybetmem.Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.27,0:05:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni piç!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.69,0:05:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Az önce komutanımıza ne dedin sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Bok parçası", "Pısırık"... Ne biçim konuşuyorsunuz lan?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.70,0:05:44.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bizler Doğu Mavi'nin en güçlüsü, Krieg Korsanları'yız!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sayınız çok olduğu için öyle değil miydi?Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.88,0:05:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harbiden...Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tam üstüne bastın.Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yani haklıydım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni şerefsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni öldüreceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.84,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Bizimle alay etmeyi kes!Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geri basın!Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg!Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.85,0:06:14.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güçsüz denince öfkeleniyorsanız, gerçekten güçsüzsünüz demektir.Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.52,0:06:18.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gücünüzü yalnızca sonuç belirler.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.48,0:06:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben buradayım.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.40,0:06:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Galeyana gelmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– E-Emredersiniz! – E-Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.99,0:06:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.03,0:06:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O aşçıyı indirmek senin sorumluluğun.Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.79,0:06:34.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şuradaki asalakla ben ilgilenirim.Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı, Don Krieg.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.84,0:06:43.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, velet!Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.84,0:06:51.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğu Mavi'ye hükmeden gücün tamamını deneyimlemeni sağlayacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.72,0:06:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana sözde şeytan meyvenin ne kadar işe yaramaz olduğunu göstereceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laf, laf, laf... Ağzın durmuyor.Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.53,0:07:03.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kıçına tekmeyi basacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.61,0:07:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte o kadar.Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.15,0:07:07.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi oraya geliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dayak yemeye hazır ol!Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Küstah velet.Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O şefin işi artık bitti.Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.37,0:07:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şakası yok.Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.75,0:07:21.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin-san'ın elinde o silahın olması, ne kadar ciddi olduğunu gösterir.Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.35,0:07:31.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun lakabı...Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.26,0:07:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Deccal.Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.35,0:07:35.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düşmanı ağlasa da çığlık atsa da,Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ona ölene kadar acımasızca işkence eder.Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O merhamet kırıntısı olmayan bir iblis...Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.49,0:07:49.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm, Sanji-san ama sen beni yenemezsin.Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.95,0:07:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Konuşmaya devam et, seni küçük balık.Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte geliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni...Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.02,0:08:23.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görüşürüz...Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.24,0:08:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece yenilgini kabul et!Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Komutan inanılmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.13,0:08:46.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ez onu, Gin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Sanji! – Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.51,0:08:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.18,0:08:55.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geber!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.29,0:09:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O aşçı, Gin-san'a bir darbe indirdi...Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin-san da yenilecek mi şimdi...?Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.63,0:09:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sizi aptallar...Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.88,0:09:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunca zamandır o gözlerinizle neler gördünüz?Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.22,0:09:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin, benim güvendiğim soğukkanlı bir şeytan.Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.31,0:09:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden onu komutanınız olarak atadım.Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.69,0:09:45.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yakında gerçek yüzünü gösterecektir.Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.11,0:09:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji gerçekten de iyi mi sizce?Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Değil, elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kalkan adamın saldırıları ile beraber,Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.91,0:09:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,en az 5 veya 6 tane kırık kaburgası olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O şişteki dangolar...Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.87,0:10:04.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,düşündüğüm kadar...Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,iyi değiller.Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Komutanın en iyisi bu mu?Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir zamanda ne yapıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır! Kıçını tekmelemek için açıkta!Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.03,0:10:31.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kendini çok zorlama.Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.83,0:10:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik! Dövüşmek istemiyor musun?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.63,0:10:52.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dövüşmek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.05,0:10:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle bir şey yapmama gerek yok.Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.43,0:10:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Önemli olan, işi çözecek araç.Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.22,0:10:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hepsi bu.Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.22,0:11:01.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Erkeklerin güç gösterisi böyledir, çocuk.Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.06,0:11:03.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hatırla bunu, seni maymun!Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir maymunu hafife alırsan, çizilirsin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.78,0:11:14.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.21,0:11:27.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın! Kemikleri şimdiden parçalandı!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bitir işini!Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.17,0:11:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! O kalkanlı adamdan hasar almasaydı...Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.17,0:11:36.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O demir toplardan şimdiye dek on darbe yemiş olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.01,0:11:42.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cidden kafana eseni yapıyorsun,...Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.47,0:11:45.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seni küçük balık!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.98,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Lanet olsun...Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.98,0:11:56.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten de güçlü...Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşini bitireceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Direnme artık.Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.29,0:12:09.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da neydi?! Acıma mı?Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni küçümseme!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.80,0:12:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.76,0:12:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.77,0:12:25.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.64,0:12:30.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olamaz! Artık kendi saldırılarının etkisini bile kaldıramıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– İyi! – İyi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte bizim Gin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni...Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,lanet pislik...Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.20,0:13:26.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yapamam, Don Krieg!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin...Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.71,0:13:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.54,0:13:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bu adamı öldüremem.Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne diyorsun sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim için...Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim... Benim için...Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bir ilkti.Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.52,0:13:52.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok utanıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm...Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Teşekkür ederim...Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.57,0:13:58.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Öleceğimi düşünmüştüm.Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.11,0:14:00.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,İşimin bittiğini düşünmüştüm.Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Lezzetli...Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.45,0:14:04.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok lezzetli.Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.74,0:14:09.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,İlk kez bu kadar lezzetli bir yemek yiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.29,0:14:12.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Baya güzel, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.80,0:14:20.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.30,0:14:24.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana bedava yedirdiğin için sorun yaşacayaksın, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.05,0:14:27.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Kanıt olmadan ceza olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.73,0:14:34.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha önce kimse...Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,bana bu kadar iyi davranmamıştı.Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.69,0:14:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu adamı öldüremem!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,İstediğin zaman yine gel!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.12,0:14:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana ihanet etmek niyetinde değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.87,0:14:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şu ana kadar yaptıklarımızın da yanlış olduğunu düşünmüyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.25,0:15:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hala gücüne saygı duyuyorum ve sana minnet duyuyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.13,0:15:06.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gücüme güvenip beni komutanlığa atadığın zamanDialogue: 50,0:15:06.51,0:15:09.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,çok mutlu olmuştum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.01,0:15:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden emirlerinize uydum, bundan sonra da uyacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.14,0:15:15.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öldürmeye kıyamadığım tek kişi o!Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.90,0:15:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg...Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şartlar uygunsa...Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.45,0:15:33.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu gemiyi... bu restoranı bağışlamamızı istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni şerefsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.75,0:15:40.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Emirlerime itaatsizlik yetmedi, bir de akıl mı veriyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana ne oldu böyle?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne hayal kırıklığı...Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.97,0:15:52.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sempati ve ahlak benim için en itici şeylerdir.Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.10,0:15:54.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu hep söylemedim mi?Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çekilin yoldan, beyler.Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.02,0:16:03.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don! Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-Olamaz! MH5!Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.95,0:16:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O en ölümcül sinir gazı!Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.41,0:16:12.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.20,0:16:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sinir gazı mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maskeleriniz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.37,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Maskelerinizi takın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acele edin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.75,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Biz de öleceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.75,0:16:20.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle bir silahı kullanmak...Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.38,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu alçaklık, seni piç!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu kullanırsan ne olur biliyor musun?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sızlanmayı kesin, sizi aptallar.Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.71,0:16:27.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunların hiçbir önemi yok.Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu bir savaş!Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kazanmak tek hedef.Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.56,0:16:35.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hileli oynamak mı? Adaletsizlik mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne var bunda?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güçlü olan haklıdır.Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.98,0:16:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nelere başvurursak başvuralım, sonuç her şeydir.Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sinir gazı kullanıyorsam ne olmuş?Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Önemli olan zaferdir!Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Güç budur.Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne çürümüş bir piç...!Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.88,0:17:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O gaz maskesini at!Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Artık bizden biri değilsin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geber!Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.39,0:17:22.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O sinir gazını ateşlemene izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ortalıkta koşuşturmayı bırak, çapa velet!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.75,0:17:39.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.29,0:17:42.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O korkağın söylediklerini dinlemek zorunda değilsin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi onun kıçını tekmeleyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg ile alay etme!Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O eşsizdir.Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.39,0:17:58.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu yenemezsin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aklını başına topla, aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O adam seni öldürmeye çalışıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu hakettim...Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.36,0:18:08.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görevimi yerine getiremediğim için,Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.48,0:18:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,utanmadan duygularıma yenildiğim için...Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu...Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tamamen hakettim!Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.66,0:18:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neden... Neden?Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.87,0:18:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonunda onurunu gösteriyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.75,0:18:26.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama çok geç.Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.88,0:18:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O aşçıyla birlikte öl!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sinir gazı...Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.76,0:18:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,M...Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.55,0:18:33.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H...Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.51,0:18:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,5!Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.97,0:18:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.43,0:18:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Denize dalın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.89,0:18:44.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patron! Restorana girin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ödünç alıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.07,0:18:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunları kullanın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kamarot!Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.86,0:18:54.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi de bana!Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.41,0:18:58.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Herkes denize dalmış!Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.33,0:19:09.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağım?! Ne yapacağım?! Ne yapacağım?! Ne yapacağım?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.09,0:19:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte bu...Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.43,0:19:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,güç.Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.86,0:19:36.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K... Kurtuldum...Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.15,0:19:38.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İyi ki maske bulmuşum.Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne çılgın bir piç.Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.00,0:19:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Savaşta sinir gazı kullandığına inanamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-O bir iblis...Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.88,0:19:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet, bu bir insanın yapacağı iş değil!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji ve kamarot iyi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Emin değilim...Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bakın! Zehirli sis dağılıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.83,0:20:25.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak...Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maskeyi bırak!Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.63,0:20:35.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.59,0:20:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Masken nerede?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.30,0:20:42.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana...Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.64,0:20:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,kendi maskeni mi verdin?Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.22,0:20:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.39,0:20:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne aptal ama.Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.90,0:20:54.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hissettiğin acı, bir lokma yemek için duyduğun minnetin sonucudur.Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.65,0:20:58.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre ahmaklar ölmeden ders almıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.24,0:21:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don...Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.33,0:21:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg...Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.75,0:21:09.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin...Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.63,0:21:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin, sen...Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.88,0:21:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Takip etmek için yanlış kişiyi seçmişsin gibi görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.31,0:21:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O pisliğe gerçekten sempati mi duyuyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.81,0:21:31.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pislik mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.77,0:21:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle.Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.36,0:21:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hedefimizi gözden kaçıran ve emirlerime uymayan bir aptal...Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.57,0:21:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,benim için değersizdir.Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.03,0:21:43.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana yine ihanet etmeyeceğinin garantisi yok.Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.28,0:21:46.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acısısına son vermemi sağlayan şey sevgi. Anlamıyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.24,0:21:51.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D... Donun komutanı öldüreceğini asla düşünmemiştim.Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Bu olamaz...Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.37,0:21:54.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu yapmasına imkan yok!Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.00,0:21:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gin-san onun sağ kolu!Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.34,0:22:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kimse Don'a Gin-san'dan daha sadık olmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman da öyleydi.Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.22,0:22:09.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fullbody ve Donanma, Grand Line’dan kaçarken peşimize düştüklerinde...Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet...Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.18,0:22:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don rolünü üstlenip tek başına yem oldu.Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.90,0:22:19.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg için savaşırken hep hayatını riske attı.Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don'un gerçekten de onu öldürecek olması...Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.66,0:22:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok kötü...Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.41,0:22:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patty! Panzehirimiz var değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.41,0:22:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Panzehir mi? Gıda zehirlenmesi için ilaçlarımız var.Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.83,0:22:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Farketmez! Sadece buraya getir!Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.84,0:22:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.42,0:22:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer onu kurtarmak istiyorsan hemen maskeyi tak!Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.05,0:22:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir tür zehiri etkisizleştirme etkisi olması gerek!Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.76,0:22:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu ikinci kata getir ve iyice nefes aldır.Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.97,0:22:50.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer onu kurtarmak için bir şansımız varsa, tek çare bu!Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.56,0:22:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Acele edin, Patty! Carne!Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.81,0:22:54.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam be, bir susmadın!Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.81,0:22:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben de mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.27,0:22:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boşuna.Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.77,0:23:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En fazla bir saat daha yaşar.Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.78,0:23:06.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sakın öleyim deme, Gin.Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.99,0:23:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun seni öldürmesine izin verme!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.12,0:23:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayata tutun! Anladın mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.46,0:23:17.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senin için onun kıçını tekmeleyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.08,0:23:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y-Yapma...Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.79,0:23:20.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen...Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.38,0:23:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,onu yenemezsin!Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.71,0:23:23.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sakinleş!Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.72,0:23:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğrudan saldırmak onun işine gelir. Ölebilirsin!Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.18,0:23:31.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölmeyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.68,0:23:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İstediğin kadar ateş et!Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.56,0:23:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.39,0:23:36.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tam bir aptal.Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.52,0:23:40.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,En kolay öldürülebilen düşman çılgına dönmüş olandır.Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Deniz senin cehennemindir, çapa çocuk. Şu anda gittiğin yer...Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.86,0:23:47.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte geliyor...Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.49,0:23:47.32,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Bombalar!Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.32,0:23:49.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...mezarın!Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.03,0:23:50.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mezarım mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.75,0:23:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olamaz! Kaç, kamarot!Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.38,0:24:01.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vuruldu!Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.63,0:24:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öldü.Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.05,0:24:10.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kamarot...Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.68,0:24:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni...Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.43,0:24:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lastik-LastikDialogue: 50,0:24:17.89,0:24:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vur bana...Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.77,0:24:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.86,0:24:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...yapabiliyorsan!Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.44,0:24:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu haksızlık!Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.03,0:24:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tabanca!Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.41,0:24:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.26,0:24:49.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg dövüldü!Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.97,0:24:52.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O herif de neyin nesi?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.05,0:24:54.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don'un dikenli pelerinini yumrukladı!Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.31,0:24:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.10,0:25:00.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu olamaz...Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.98,0:25:05.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdiye kadar Don'un dizlerinin üstüne düştüğünü hiç görmemiştik.Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.36,0:25:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don'un tam yüzüne vurdu!Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.28,0:25:09.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hemde dikenli pelerinin üstünden!Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.74,0:25:12.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İ-İnanabiliyor musunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.12,0:25:21.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burası benim...Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.21,0:25:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,mezarım mı?Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.84,0:25:26.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.67,0:25:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,senin mi?Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.18,0:25:33.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim...Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.47,0:25:36.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,mezarım mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.52,0:25:41.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle şeylerle...Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,benim mezarıma karar veremezsin.Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.57,0:25:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burası benim öleceğim yer değil.Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.26,0:26:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aklını kaçırmış...Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.68,0:26:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arada bir böyle aptallar görürsün.Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.22,0:26:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir hedefe gözlerini diktiklerinde onunla ölümüne savaşacak tipler.Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.27,0:26:26.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ölümüne...Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.23,0:26:28.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,savaşmak...Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.48,0:26:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer öyle biri düşmanın olursa başın belada demektir.Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.82,0:26:37.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama bilirsin,Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.83,0:26:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,kazansana da kaybetse de,Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.95,0:26:44.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onun gibi adamları severim!Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.65,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Zenginlik, şöhret, güç...Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:07.82,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi elde eden adam, Korsanlar Kralı, Gold Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:11.66,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Son sözleri dünyanın her yerinden maceracıları denize çekti.Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.66,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Hazinem mi?Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.45,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,İstiyorsanız, alabilirsiniz.Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:16.66,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Arayıp bulun!Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.25,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Bu dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi orada bıraktım!Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:26.38,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Artık herkes, hayallerinin peşinde Grand Line’a yelken açıyor!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:29.63,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Dünya, Büyük Korsan Çağı'na girdi!Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ıDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00: